NC Digital designs professional logos and brand identities for businesses in Swansea and across South Wales. From sole traders to growing local companies, we create logos that make the right first impression and hold up across every platform.

## Why your Swansea business needs a professional logo

In Swansea's busy business environment, a professional logo is often the first signal of trust a potential customer receives. It appears on your website, your van, your signage, your social media profiles, and every piece of marketing you put out. A strong logo tells people you mean business — a weak one quietly undermines everything else you're doing.

We work with businesses across Swansea and the surrounding area, giving them a visual identity that reflects what they actually do and who they do it for.

## What's included

Every logo design project includes:

- 5 initial logo concepts covering different styles and approaches
- Revisions on your chosen concept until you're 100% happy
- Brand colour palette — primary and secondary colours chosen to work together
- Typography — font pairings that complement your logo
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG — ready for web and print

See our full [logo design service](/services/logo-design/) for everything that's included.

## No AI. Designed by hand.

Every logo is created using Adobe Illustrator — no AI tools, no stock icon generators, no templates. Your logo is built specifically for your business.

## Pair it with your website

Need a website alongside your new logo? We design and build them together, applying your brand consistently across every page from day one. View our [web design service](/services/web-design/) or [browse our portfolio](/portfolio/).

## Frequently asked questions

**How much does logo design cost?**

Contact us for a quote — we offer fixed-price packages with no hidden costs.

**How long does it take?**

Most projects are completed within 5–10 working days.

**Will I own the files?**

Yes. Full ownership of all files and designs transfers to you on completion.

**Do you work with Swansea businesses only?**

No — we work with businesses across South Wales. But we're happy to take on projects anywhere.

